parameters.description:
Viewport configuration as JSON string.
Example: {"width":1920,"height":1080,"deviceScaleFactor":1}
Pass `null` to disable fixed-viewport emulation entirely: the page then follows the real browser window size (responsive; most useful in headful mode).

Geolocation configuration as JSON string.
Example: {"latitude":40.7128,"longitude":-74.0060,"accuracy":100}
Anything other than a JSON object (`null`, an array, a number) is a `400 VALIDATION_ERROR`, and so is an object without both `latitude` and `longitude` or with a negative `accuracy` (meters).

